  "skills_applied": [],
  "rationale": "For dataset reconnaissance, the plan comprehensively examines all five input tables by loading them with project dtype policy, documenting schema as the data contract, profiling missingness across all columns to identify quality issues and completely null columns, testing all candidate keys for duplicates including the composite adherence key, examining all date columns with temporal consistency checks for claim-date ordering, verifying cross-table joins to detect referential integrity issues (particularly pharmacy provider NPIs which manifest_summary shows have no match), and producing a complete report with artifact citations for reproducibility."
